<!-- SECTION 4: RESULTS, DISCUSSION & EVALUATION -->
<h2>4. RESULTS, DISCUSSION & EVALUATION</h2>

<h3>4.1 Latency Benchmarking & Performance Optimization</h3>
<p>
  Generation latency was systematically benchmarked across different generation modes:
</p>

<table>
  <tr>
    <th>Mode</th>
    <th>Target Output</th>
    <th>Processing Pipeline</th>
    <th>Average Latency</th>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Full Suite (Sequential)</strong></td>
    <td>Study Guide + 8 Questions</td>
    <td>Sequential LLM invocation</td>
    <td>34.2 seconds</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Full Suite (Parallel)</strong></td>
    <td>Study Guide + 8 Questions</td>
    <td>Concurrent Promise.all execution</td>
    <td>18.4 seconds</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Questions Only (Optimized)</strong></td>
    <td>8 Diagnostic Questions</td>
    <td>ThinkingLevel.LOW + Windowed prompt</td>
    <td><strong>4.6 seconds</strong></td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p>
  By decoupling question generation into a dedicated high-speed pathway and leveraging <code>ThinkingLevel.LOW</code>, response latency was reduced by <strong>86.5%</strong>, providing near-instant diagnostic assessments.
</p>

<h3>4.2 Comparative Examination Modes</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Interactive Quiz Mode:</strong> Single-question pagination, countdown exam timer, flag-for-review, and real-time AI short-answer grading.</li>
  <li><strong>Question Bank List Mode:</strong> Complete scrollable sheet with correct answers highlighted in green, full rationale breakdowns, distractor analyses, and print/export shortcuts.</li>
</ul>

<h3>4.3 Fault Tolerance & Transient Recovery</h3>
<p>
  The system implements exponential backoff with random jitter to gracefully manage transient upstream 503 (Model High Demand) and 429 (Rate Limit) spikes without impacting user experience:
</p>
<pre>
delay = base_delay * (2 ^ (attempt - 1)) + random_jitter
</pre>

<div class="page-break"></div>

<!-- SECTION 5: CONCLUSION AND FUTURE SCOPE -->
<h2>5. CONCLUSION AND FUTURE SCOPE</h2>

<h3>5.1 Summary of Project Achievements</h3>
<p>
  CogniLearn successfully delivers an automated, generative AI-driven study material and question generation platform. The system reliably converts raw academic text and multi-page PDFs into structured pedagogical study guides, comprehensive diagnostic examinations, real-time AI evaluations, and spaced repetition review schedules (>24h).
</p>

<h3>5.2 Limitations and Future Directions</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>LaTeX Mathematical Equation Rendering:</strong> Integration of KaTeX for complex physics and calculus notation.</li>
  <li><strong>Vector Embeddings (RAG):</strong> Implementing ChromaDB or Pinecone for textbook-scale corpora (>500 pages).</li>
  <li><strong>Multimodal Diagram Analysis:</strong> Ingesting anatomical, circuit, and flowchart illustrations using Gemini Vision.</li>
</ul>

